          }
        },
        "testimonial_PwHcLM": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "text": "<p>I've spent SO much money on gua sha, ice rollers, creams… none of it touched the morning puffiness like this does. Wish I found it sooner.<br/><br/></p>",
            "author": "Megan O'Brien",
            "author_info": "",
            "author_url": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/19eb89ba9e0b85c06fc8b0b1deda5547_e3d33346-d2f2-45e4-8441-654f5c9d2139.png",
            "image_ratio": "rounded",
            "image_height": 30,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_jkUh6R": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "text": "<p>My esthetician actually recommended I get one for between appointments. That says everything. The 42° heat feels amazing before bed.</p>",
            "author": "Theresa Kim",
            "author_info": "",
            "author_url": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/7.png",
            "image_ratio": "rounded",
            "image_height": 30,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_VNkptW": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "text": "<p>I was skeptical of the \"80% is your neck\" claim but the depuffing is real. My under-eye bags in the AM are basically gone. The gravity/26° angle actually makes sense once you feel i</p>",
            "author": "Anyone else obsessed with the neck-drainage thing? (not an ad)",
            "author_info": "",
            "author_url": "",
            "image_ratio": "rounded",
            "image_height": 30,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Npz4kx": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "quote",
            "text": "<p>Jawline is noticeably more defined and I'm not doing anything else different. It's the only \"device\" I've kept using past week one because you literally just lie on it.</p>",
            "author": "Update: 4 weeks in with the QuestProps pillow",
